From: Codex local A376B compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Hide omitted M2 Bixby remap and retain original key703 carrier

Reason: attempt43.txt:2568 fails compiled remapper requirement. Patch0036
omitted its incompatible A37 KeyGestureEvent hook but UI/keylayout stayed
active. User explicitly chose omission/original keylayout on22/10/2026.
Files: Settings module, device-stack keylayout writer, finalization keylayout
fixer, boot-contract and release-default verifiers (listed in diff).
Use stock G965F Generic.kl/AZH4 vendor WINK mapping for M2, hide selector and
reject app selector; preserve other donor remapping. Verify all seven omitted
feature/control XML keys absent in compiled output, supported positive control
present, every703 carrier WINK and vendor KL identical to donor SHA256.
Verification: source/stage KL comparison, syntax, patch replay, rebuilt
SecSettings, compiled boot/default gates, original fork resume/package.
No kernel/radio/ADB changes. Hardware key behavior still needs device logs.

